Cell["\<\
Comments on chart: 

\[Bullet] A legend is needed b/c there is more than one line plotted on the \
graph.  If you only have one set of points you should not have a legend.  \
Note the format of the title (x-variable vs. y-variable of verb noun, \
INITIALS of creator of graph)
\[Bullet] The axes labels use the correct abbreviation for the variable \
represented and the units in ( ).
\
\>", "Text",
